# Nothing Phone (1) / SM7325 (lahaina) SoC config.
# Concatenation of the vendor fragment stack the UT port merges onto
# gki_defconfig, so Droidian's fragment merge applies the same SoC
# drivers (QMI helpers, IPA, rmnet, etc). Order matches the UT build:
# lahaina_ALLYES_GKI -> lahaina_QGKI -> debugfs -> vendor/halium.

